+## Adopt deliberately
+
+- **GitHub Spec Kit:** constitution → specification → plan → independent tasks → implementation proof.
+- **HumanLayer 12-Factor Agents:** explicit context construction, structured state, pause/resume, visible control flow, human approval at consequential boundaries.
+- **Super Productivity:** project context, timeboxing, saved views, local ownership, links/notes/commands attached to project work.
+- **Taskwarrior:** explicit waiting/delegated/ready states, annotations, deterministic reports. Do not import its universal urgency-score philosophy.
+- **Monica:** private relationship context, interactions, reminders, meaningful follow-up. Use patterns only; do not copy AGPL code or create a sales CRM.
+- **Aider:** compact repository mapping, reversible small edits, immediate lint/test loops, diff-first review.
+- **Beads:** dependency-aware ready work, explicit blockers, persistent mission memory. Do not install a second database or let it become canonical.
+- **ai-dev-tasks:** one visible task file with independently checkable subtasks and relevant-file references.
+- **Vikunja:** saved views and relation affordances, pattern only.
+- **SilverBullet / Memos:** provenance-preserving knowledge links and promotion to action, pattern only.
