+
+- zero keys and no network;
+- present/absent/invalid/expired key status without value exposure;
+- success, 401, 403, model missing, timeout, 429, 5xx, malformed response, and stream interruption;
+- free-price unknown/non-free;
+- privacy denied before transport;
+- capability/context mismatch;
+- quota exhaustion and reset;
+- compatible/incompatible fallback;
+- circuit open/half-open/recovery;
+- exact provenance;
+- no prompt/response content in usage receipts;
